OL,3,GNEWSARNLI strikers to protest at
OL,4,Aheadquarters
OL,5,
OL,6,FStriking RNLI workers are to
OL,7,Fdemonstrate outside the charity's
OL,8,Fheadquarters in a dispute over job
OL,9,Flosses and redundancy terms.
OL,11,FUnite members from the Inshore Lifeboat
OL,12,FCentre (ILC) in East Cowes, Isle of
OL,13,FWight, are due to gather at the
OL,14,Fcharity's Poole headquarters on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FUp to 70 jobs are at risk after the
OL,18,FRNLI said it would move production of
OL,19,Fits inshore lifeboats from East Cowes
OL,20,Fto Poole by the end of 2027, with the
OL,21,Funion accusing management of refusing
OL,22,Fto negotiate fair redundancy terms.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
